N/A  ([https://supremevalues.com/mm2/ Supreme])}}'''Gingerbread''' is an {{C|Uncommon|uncommon}} knife that was obtainable from the [[2025 Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2025]] in [[Murder Mystery 2]]. It was also one of the weapons used to craft the [[Bokeh]] effect.

== Appearance ==
Gingerbread has a black handle and a blade designed to resemble gingerbread, featuring two gingerbread man decorations and white dot patterns that mimic icing or sugar. 

== Trivia ==

* It has a [[Gingerbread Gun (2025)|matching gun]] under the same name.
